<title>FINLAND: LEMMINKAINEN WINS FIM 250 MLN CONTRACTS.</title>
<headline>LEMMINKAINEN WINS FIM 250 MLN CONTRACTS.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-10-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish construction company Lemminkainen Oy said in a statement on Monday it had won new contracts in Finland, Sweden and Russia worth about 250 million markka in total.</p>
</text>
